Batch coverage passed strongly:

```text
TRAIN      states 94.12% | episodes 91.11%
VALIDATION states 94.18% | episodes 94.12%
TEST       states 100.00% | episodes 100.00%
```

Frozen candidate family:

```text
GAP1 = L2->L3 / current corridor width
GAP2 = L3->L4 / current corridor width
GAP3 = L4->L5 / current corridor width
STACK_CV = coefficient of variation of the three gaps
```

Features were frozen at episode origin, transformed with log1p and TRAIN z-score. The exact Exp21 SEMI kernel remained frozen. New terms entered ADVANCE-vs-STAY only.

TRAIN-only joint coefficients were all positive:

```text
GAP1     +0.091363
GAP2     +0.102712
GAP3     +0.118859
STACK_CV +0.102264
```

